---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config.js';
---
<Base title={`About | ${SITE.name}`} description="What The Style News is, and who publishes it.">
  <p class="kicker">About</p>
  <h1>Men's style, decoded</h1>
  <div class="body">
    <p>The Style News writes about men's clothing with one question in mind: what is
    actually worth owning, and how do you tell the difference? We're less interested in
    what's new than in what lasts — fabric, construction, and the small decisions that
    separate something you wear for a season from something you wear for years.</p>

    <p>We're based in Amsterdam, and it shows. A lot of what we cover comes out of
    this city, because a lot of the interesting thinking about making things properly
    does too.</p>

    <p>{SITE.disclosure} Where we recommend something outside that range, we make
    nothing from it.</p>

    <p>Questions or corrections: <a href="mailto:hello@thestylenews.com">hello@thestylenews.com</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
